---
description: Portfolio interview, response format, content accuracy and fixed art direction
alwaysApply: true
---

Before responding or editing, read the repository-root AGENTS.md in full.
Follow its Korean interview and response format. Ask detailed follow-up questions
about the user's own contribution and evidence. Do not infer facts from samples.
For art read docs/ART_DIRECTION.md, ART_STYLE.md, ART_RECIPES.md,
ART_DECISIONS.md and ART_REVIEW.md. Keep immediate meaning and visual impact,
one symbol source per subject, and the fixed line/light/camera grammar.
Do not restart the art-style interview. Run npm run check-art; it does not replace
live visual and motion review. Read docs/CONTENT_GUIDE.md for content changes.
Colors and signal palettes are freely editable in content/theme.json;
read docs/THEME_GUIDE.md and do not lock the default hues.
User instructions take precedence over repository guidance.
